msgstr "<qt>KDE solicitó acceder a la cartera «<b>%1</b>», yá abierta.</qt>"

#: kwalletd.cpp:604
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>The application '<b>%1</b>' has requested access to the open wallet '<b>"
