"<qt>L'aplicación «<b>%1</b>» solicitó acceder a la cartera «<b>%2</b>», yá "
"abierta.</qt>"

#: kwalletd.cpp:691
msgid ""
"Unable to open wallet. The wallet must be opened in order to change the "
